<!--
  InfoWebWorld — proposed sitemap reflecting the current site structure
  (May 2026). Reference document for review, NOT for submission to
  Search Console as-is.

  Structure:
    · Static marketing & informational pages (1.0 - 0.6 priority)
    · L1 sector landings (0.9)
    · /categories index (0.85)
    · /listing/<slug> placeholder (0.7) — illustrative; the actual
       URL list comes from `submissions.slug WHERE status='active'`
    · /blog index + posts placeholder (0.7) — illustrative; actual
       posts from `blog_posts WHERE status='published'`

  When this becomes the live sitemap, the listing + blog + category
  blocks should be emitted dynamically from the DB (see the existing
  app/sitemap.ts.bak which already does exactly that).
-->
