  <!--
    L2-L5 category landings — emit dynamically from the DB:
      SELECT slug FROM categories
       WHERE is_launched = 1 AND is_active = 1 AND is_navigation = 1
         AND level BETWEEN 2 AND 5
    URL pattern: /<sector>/<l2>/<l3?>/<l4?>/<l5?>
    Total taxonomy: 6 L1 + 120 L2 + 3,054 L3 + 4,827 L4 + 842 L5 = 8,849 categories
    (only the `is_launched` subset actually emits URLs).
  -->

